  sma_rising_lookback                5 → 10
  require_prior_uptrend           True → False
  require_sma50_rising            True → False
  require_volume_confirmation     True → False
  min_price                         2 → 1
  min_avg_volume                80000 → 50000

  ⚙️  BACKTEST TUNING
